  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IAIA OfD Capacity Building Stipend Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme provides training and knowledge to impact assessment professionals that are working to sustainably manage their country&#x2019;s petroleum resources. Based on institutional collaboration, IAIA is proposing to continue and bolster its capacity-building partnership with Norad and its Oil for Development programme to strengthen the impact assessment knowledge in governmental ministries and other institutions in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
